@startuml AIC_Dual_Call_Component
title 《天台十句》AIC · 双调用架构\n<size:14>UML 组件图 · 主回合的逻辑职责与依赖</size>

top to bottom direction
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "Microsoft YaHei"
skinparam defaultFontSize 17
skinparam titleFontSize 22
skinparam CaptionFontSize 14
skinparam ArrowColor #64748B
skinparam ArrowThickness 1.3
skinparam ArrowFontSize 15
skinparam componentStyle uml2
skinparam componentBorderColor #64748B
skinparam componentFontColor #172B4D
skinparam componentBackgroundColor #F8FAFC
skinparam componentFontSize 17
skinparam packageStyle frame
skinparam packageBorderColor #CBD5E1
skinparam packageFontColor #334155
skinparam packageFontSize 16
skinparam packageBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam padding 14
skinparam nodesep 36
skinparam ranksep 36

package "浏览器 · Vue 3 / Pinia" {
  component "主线客户端\n<size:14>GameView / gameStore / LLMService</size>\n\n自由输入 · 机会计数\n响应归一化 · 信任结算\n状态 / CG / 结局反馈" as Client #F0F5FB
}

package "后端 · Go / Gin" {
  component "回合编排\n<size:14>HandleChat → llm.Chat()</size>\n\n组织两次顺序调用\n清洗对白 · 组装响应" as Chat #EAF1FB

  together {
    component "剧情 LLM\n<size:14>buildMainSystemPrompt()</size>\n\n角色事实 + 完整历史\n生成自然对白" as Story #EBF5F3
    component "裁判 LLM\n<size:14>EvaluateTurn()</size>\n\n本句 + 对白 + 最近历史\n生成 evaluation JSON" as Judge #F1EFF9
    component "程序守门\n<size:14>parseTurnEvaluation()</size>\n<size:14>enforceSafeExitTrust()</size>\n\n字段归一化\n信任门槛校验" as Gate #FFF4E6
  }

  Story -[hidden]right-> Judge
  Judge -[hidden]right-> Gate
}

Client -down-> Chat : POST /api/chat
Chat ..> Story : ① 剧情生成
Chat ..> Judge : ② 沟通评价
Chat ..> Gate : ③ 规则校验

caption 实线：HTTP 调用；虚线：组件依赖。调用次序见时序图。\n剧情与裁判使用同一 ClientConfig；提示、复盘与安全回访使用独立入口。
@enduml

